{"title": "List of cities in Bavaria by population", "html": "<p>\nThe following list sorts all cities and municipalities in the German state of <a data-title=\"Bavaria\">Bavaria</a> with a population of more than 20,000. As of May 15, 2022, 75 places fulfill this criterion and are listed here. This list refers only to the population of individual municipalities within their <a data-title=\"City limits\">defined limits</a>, which does not include other municipalities or suburban areas within <a data-title=\"Urban agglomeration\">urban agglomerations</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"wr-List\">List</h2></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\"><img class=\"mw-file-element\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"167\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Frauenkirche_and_Neues_Rathaus_Munich_March_2013.JPG/250px-Frauenkirche_and_Neues_Rathaus_Munich_March_2013.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Frauenkirche_and_Neues_Rathaus_Munich_March_2013.JPG/500px-Frauenkirche_and_Neues_Rathaus_Munich_March_2013.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" width=\"250\"><figcaption><a data-title=\"Munich\">Munich</a></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\"><img class=\"mw-file-element\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"154\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Nuremberg_panorama_morning_3.jpg/250px-Nuremberg_panorama_morning_3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Nuremberg_panorama_morning_3.jpg/500px-Nuremberg_panorama_morning_3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" width=\"250\"><figcaption><a data-title=\"Nuremberg\">Nuremberg</a></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\"><img class=\"mw-file-element\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Augsburg_-_Markt.jpg/250px-Augsburg_-_Markt.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Augsburg_-_Markt.jpg/500px-Augsburg_-_Markt.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" width=\"250\"><figcaption><a data-title=\"Augsburg\">Augsburg</a></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\"><img class=\"mw-file-element\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"146\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Rgbg-dom_und_rathaus.jpg/250px-Rgbg-dom_und_rathaus.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Rgbg-dom_und_rathaus.jpg/500px-Rgbg-dom_und_rathaus.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" width=\"250\"><figcaption><a data-title=\"Regensburg\">Regensburg</a></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\"><img class=\"mw-file-element\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"58\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Ingolstadt_Panorama_Nord.jpg/250px-Ingolstadt_Panorama_Nord.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Ingolstadt_Panorama_Nord.jpg/500px-Ingolstadt_Panorama_Nord.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" width=\"250\"><figcaption><a data-title=\"Ingolstadt\">Ingolstadt</a></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\"><img class=\"mw-file-element\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"167\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/comm