default-size\"><img class=\"mw-file-element\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"68\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Bamberg_Panorama_2016.jpg/250px-Bamberg_Panorama_2016.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Bamberg_Panorama_2016.jpg/500px-Bamberg_Panorama_2016.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" width=\"250\"><figcaption><a data-title=\"Bamberg\">Bamberg</a></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\"><img class=\"mw-file-element\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"181\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Schweinfurt_und_der_Main_bei_Nacht.jpg/250px-Schweinfurt_und_der_Main_bei_Nacht.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Schweinfurt_und_der_Main_bei_Nacht.jpg/500px-Schweinfurt_und_der_Main_bei_Nacht.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" width=\"250\"><figcaption><a data-title=\"Schweinfurt\">Schweinfurt</a></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The following table lists the 75 cities and municipalities in Bavaria with a population of at least 20,000 on May 15, 2022, as estimated by the <a data-title=\"Federal Statistical Office of Germany\">Federal Statistical Office of Germany</a>. A city is displayed in <b>bold</b> if it is a state or federal capital.\n</p>\n<ol><li>The city rank by population as of May 15, 2022, as enumerated by the 2022 German census</li>\n<li>The city name</li>\n<li>The name of the district (Landkreis) in which the city lies (some cities are districts on their own called urban districts)</li>\n<li>The city population as of May 15, 2022, as enumerated by the 2022 German census</li>\n<li>The city population as of May 9, 2011, as enumerated by the <a data-title=\"2011 European Union census\">2011 European Union census</a></li>\n<li>The city land area as of May 15, 2022</li>\n<li>The city population density as of May 15, 2022 (residents per unit of land area)</li>\n<li>Yearly population growth since 2011</li></ol>\n<div class=\"wiki-table-scroll\"><table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>2022<br>rank\n</th>\n<th>City\n</th>\n<th>District\n</th>\n<th>2022 census\n</th>\n<th>2011 census\n</th>\n<th>2022 land area\n</th>\n<th>2022 pop. density\n</th>\n<th>Growth (2011\u20132022)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b><a data-title=\"Munich\">Munich</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>urban district\n</td>\n<td>1,478,638\n</td>\n<td>1,348,335\n</td>\n<td>311&nbsp;km<sup>2</sup>\n</td>\n<td>4,759/km<sup>2</sup>\n</td>\n<td>+0.84%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><a data-title=\"Nuremberg\">Nuremberg</a>\n</td>\n<td>urban district\n</td>\n<td>522,554\n</td>\n<td>486,314\n</td>\n<td>186&nbsp;km<sup>2</sup>\n</td>\n<td>2,803/km<sup>2</sup>\n</td>\n<td>+0.65%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><a data-title=\"Augsburg\">Augsburg</a>\n</td>\n<td>urban district\n</td>\n<td>294,647\n</td>\n<td>267,767\n</td>\n<td>147&nbsp;km<sup>2</sup>\n</td>\n<td>2,006/km<sup>2</sup>\n</td>\n<td>+0.87%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><a data-title=\"Regensburg\">Regensburg</a>\n</td>\n<td>urban district\n</td>\n<td>145,901\n</td>\n<td>135,403\n</td>\n<td>80.9&nbsp;km<sup>2</sup>\n</td>\n<td>1,894/km<sup>2</sup>\n</td>\n<td>+0.68%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5\n</td>\n<td><a data-title=\"Ingolstadt\">Ingolstadt</a>\n</td>\n<td>urban district\n</td>\n<td>136,468\n</td>\n<td>124,927\n</td>\n<td>133&nbsp;km<sup>2</sup>\n</td>\n<td>1,023/km<sup>2</sup>\n</td>\n<td>+0.81%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6\n</td>\n<td><a data-title=\"W\u00fcrzburg\">W\u00fcrzburg</a>\n</td>\n<td>urban district\n</td>\n<td>131,316\n</td>\n<td>124,297\n</td>\n<td>87.6&nbsp;km<sup>2</sup>\n</td>\n<td>1,499/km<sup>2</sup>\n</td>\n<td>+0.50%\n</